# Google OAuth Web Application Client ID for the deployed PWA.
# This value is PUBLIC — it ends up in the JavaScript bundle. What protects
# it is the Authorized JavaScript origins setting on the OAuth client in
# GCP. The Client Secret is never used in the browser flow.
#
# For local dev: copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your Client ID.
# For production: set as a repository variable in GitHub Actions and the
# deploy workflow will pass it through.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
